1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:06,800
I'm so tired of this world…

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,800
Where do my tears even go?

3
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:14,300
Nobody noticed a thing…

4
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,300
Nobody bothered to know…

5
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:26,300
Who are you…?

6
00:00:27,324 --> 00:00:28,564
Who? Who?

7
00:00:28,564 --> 00:00:32,164
I am the world that broke my own heart

8
00:00:32,164 --> 00:00:34,564
Me and my soul picked up every shard

9
00:00:34,564 --> 00:00:37,264
I laughed on the surface, I drowned in the deep

10
00:00:37,264 --> 00:00:40,264
I kept on walking even in the dark

11
00:00:40,264 --> 00:00:43,564
Every time I try to rise, I fall again

12
00:00:43,564 --> 00:00:46,964
Every time I fall, I rise again

13
00:00:46,964 --> 00:00:50,464
So I tell myself, "Get up…"

14
00:00:52,744 --> 00:00:55,364
Who are you?!

15
00:00:55,904 --> 00:01:02,564
I am the world… and I'll get through

16
00:01:02,744 --> 00:01:07,264
I am the wound… and I'll heal it too

17
00:01:07,264 --> 00:01:10,364
I'm the one who fell… and I'll stand

18
00:01:10,364 --> 00:01:20,164
I'm the one who drowned… and I'll swim to land

19
00:01:20,164 --> 00:01:23,764
My heart called the ache a warm, safe home

20
00:01:23,764 --> 00:01:27,264
I bury my tears in my pillow alone

21
00:01:27,264 --> 00:01:30,164
I sell them a smile and I buy the pain

22
00:01:30,164 --> 00:01:33,864
Then I lock myself in with my soul again

23
00:01:33,864 --> 00:01:36,564
Every time I fall, I rise again

24
00:01:36,564 --> 00:01:39,364
So I tell myself, "Get up!"

25
00:01:39,704 --> 00:01:46,064
Who are you?! Who are you?!

26
00:01:46,064 --> 00:01:52,764
I am the world… and I'll get through

27
00:01:52,944 --> 00:01:57,564
I am the wound… and I'll heal it too

28
00:01:57,564 --> 00:02:00,564
I'm the one who fell… and I'll stand

29
00:02:00,564 --> 00:02:10,164
I'm the one who drowned… and I'll swim to land

30
00:02:10,164 --> 00:02:12,964
I don't dream of rising higher,

31
00:02:12,964 --> 00:02:17,164
I just want a place to rest

32
00:02:17,164 --> 00:02:19,864
I'm putting the world on mute tonight

33
00:02:19,864 --> 00:02:23,664
and letting the silence fill my chest

34
00:02:23,664 --> 00:02:26,964
If I regret it, then let it be

35
00:02:26,964 --> 00:02:29,864
I'd rather be sorry than never be free

36
00:02:29,864 --> 00:02:35,564
Oh, world… Oh, world…

37
00:02:35,564 --> 00:02:38,364
Could you go easy on me, world,

38
00:02:38,364 --> 00:02:39,964
instead of making me strong?

39
00:02:39,964 --> 00:02:41,364
Love me the way my heart can hold

40
00:02:41,404 --> 00:02:42,964
and not a moment too long

41
00:02:42,964 --> 00:02:47,264
Enough… Enough… Enough… Enough… Who are you?!

42
00:02:56,324 --> 00:02:58,564
I am the world… and I got through

43
00:02:58,564 --> 00:03:03,764
I am the wound… and I healed it too

44
00:03:03,884 --> 00:03:06,864
I'm the one who fell… and I stood

45
00:03:06,864 --> 00:03:10,444
I'm the one who drowned… and I swam for good

46
00:03:10,524 --> 00:03:13,564
It's me… it's me…

47
00:03:13,804 --> 00:03:16,364
It was always me

48
00:03:16,584 --> 00:03:18,964
World, I raised them up so high,

49
00:03:18,964 --> 00:03:22,364
they flew and left my hands holding sky

50
00:03:22,364 --> 00:03:28,764
…holding sky

51
00:03:28,984 --> 00:03:32,304
I'm not the one who should feel ashamed

52
00:03:32,344 --> 00:03:35,864
No shame on the hands that kept them safe

53
00:03:35,904 --> 00:03:41,564
The shame belongs to the ones I saved!

54
00:03:42,044 --> 00:03:47,464
I am the world… and I got through

55
00:03:48,424 --> 00:03:50,964
Fly if you want…

56
00:03:51,824 --> 00:03:54,164
The sky is me

57
00:03:54,504 --> 00:04:05,544
It was always me

58
00:04:05,604 --> 00:04:08,564
It was always me…
